 change chg-eu-2048 moved eu-west-1 POST /orders/submit from healthy checkout-v1-eu to checkout-v2-eu, which had zero registered/healthy endpoints (rollout-842 paused before endpoint registration), so the edge returned 503 no_healthy_upstream.\"\n      },\n      \"appendPosition\": 22,\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:31:01.961Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"con_f1e36d301e284e19\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n      \"actor\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_c9ec6174fe834878\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_045b424ccb43467e\",\n      \"action\": \"create\",\n      \"objectType\": \"decision\",\n      \"objectId\": \"dec_f09b0b6a950d4c0b\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"summary\": \"Mitigate by reverting the eu-west-1 POST /orders/submit route chg-eu-2048 from checkout-v2-eu back to checkout-v1-eu, and keep rollout-842 paused until checkout-v2-eu has registered healthy endpoints before re-cutting.\",\n        \"status\": \"proposed\"\n      },\n      \"appendPosition\": 23,\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:31:08.052Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"con_b033641d1f0e4fba\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n      \"actor\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_c9ec6174fe834878\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_045b424ccb43467e\",\n      \"action\": \"update\",\n      \"objectType\": \"decision\",\n      \"objectId\": \"dec_f09b0b6a950d4c0b\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"summary\": \"cites find_392e265849f54d51\",\n        \"findingId\": \"find_392e265849f54d51\",\n        \"note\": \"Root-cause finding supports reverting to the healthy pre-change upstream.\"\n      },\n      \"appendPosition\": 24,\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:31:10.124Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"con_70f97936885541d7\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n      \"actor\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_c9ec6174fe834878\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_045b424ccb43467e\",\n      \"action\": \"create\",\n      \"objectType\": \"task\",\n      \"objectId\": \"task_bfe056ab4e9349d7\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"title\": \"Get incident-commander approval for proposed route rollback, then revert chg-eu-2048 to checkout-v1-eu\"\n      },\n      \"appendPosition\": 25,\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:31:12.002Z\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"provenanceTotal\": 25,\n  \"provenanceTruncated\": true,\n  \"needsYou\": [\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"decision\",\n      \"id\": \"dec_f09b0b6a950d4c0b\",\n      \"summary\": \"Mitigate by reverting the eu-west-1 POST /orders/submit route chg-eu-2048 from checkout-v2-eu back to checkout-v1-eu, and keep rollout-842 paused until checkout-v2-eu has registered healthy endpoints before re-cutting.\",\n      \"status\": \"proposed\",\n      \"reason\": \"proposed_decision_actionable\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"task\",\n      \"id\": \"task_bfe056ab4e9349d7\",\n      \"summary\": \"Get incident-commander approval for proposed route rollback, then revert chg-eu-2048 to checkout-v1-eu\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"reason\": \"assigned_open_task\",\n      \"assignee\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_9d67e3f667294acd\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"needsAttention\": [],\n  \"currentWork\": {\n    \"inProgressTasks\": [],\n    \"blockedTasks\": [],\n    \"acceptedDecisions\": []\n  },\n  \"suggestedNextAction\": {\n    \"kind\": \"decision\",\n    \"id\": \"dec_f09b0b6a950d4c0b\",\n\n...3839 bytes truncated...\n\nThe tool call succeeded but the output was truncated. Full output saved to: /home/agent/.local/share/opencode/tool-output/tool_119c7f9aa001OrgiN3gbkRcpXQ\nUse the Task tool to have explore agent process this file with Grep and Read (with offset/limit). Do NOT read the full file yourself - delegate to save context.","metadata":{"truncated":true,"outputPath":"/home/agent